"Allows users to submit Quotations with zero quantity. Useful when rates are "
"fixed but the quantities are not. Eg. Rate Contracts."
msgstr ""
"Permet aux utilisateurs de soumettre des devis avec une quantité nulle. "
"Utile lorsque les tarifs sont fixés mais pas les quantités. Ex. Contrats de "
"tarifs."

#. Description of the 'Allow Request for Quotation with Zero Quantity' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json
